  "combat_log": [
   "[color=#FFD700]You encounter a [/color][color=#FFFF00]★ Nazgul Champion[/color][color=#FFD700] (Lvl 101)![/color]\r\n[url=CHAMPION — 180% of a normal one's HP and 368% of its damage. A long fight, worth 1.5x XP and better loot.][color=#FFD700]★ CHAMPION ★[/color][/url]\n[color=#808080]Traits: [url=Life Stealer — Heals itself for half the damage it deals you.][color=#FF4444]Life Stealer[/color][/url], [url=* CUNNING PREY * — Drops TRICKSTER gear — 35%, or guaranteed if a Scroll of Finding marked it.][color=#1EFF00]* CUNNING PREY *[/color][/url], [url=! XP DRAINER ! — Steals 1-3% of your experience when it hits you.][color=#FF00FF]! XP DRAINER ![/color][/url], [url=Ambusher — Its first attack has a 75% chance to land at 1.75x damage, and it is likelier to move first.][color=#FF00FF]Ambusher[/color][/url], [url=Berserker — Deals +50% damage once it drops below half HP.][color=#FF6600]Berserker[/color][/url], [url=Ethereal — A third of your attacks pass straight through it - though it is less accurate in return.][color=#CC99FF]Ethereal[/color][/url], [url=Causes Bleeding — 40% chance on hit to stack a bleed, up to 3, each worth 15% of its strength a turn.][color=#FF4444]Causes Bleeding[/color][/url], [url=Curse — 30% chance to cut your defence by 25 for the rest of the fight. Wisdom resists up to half.][color=#BA55D3]Curse[/color][/url], [url=Weakening — 30% chance to cut your attack damage by 25% for 20 turns - which outlasts the fight.][color=#FFA500]Weakening[/color][/url], [url=Disarming — 25% chance to disarm you: -30% damage for 3 rounds.][color=#FF8800]Disarming[/color][/url], [url=Slowing Aura — Its aura cuts your chance to flee by 25%.][color=#808080]Slowing Aura[/color][/url][/color]\n[color=#FF00FF]⚠ TIER +1 — Extreme danger! (2x XP if you survive)[/color]",
   "[color=#FF4444]⚔ ★ Nazgul Champion strikes first![/color]",
   "[color=#FF0000]AMBUSH! The ★ Nazgul Champion strikes from the shadows![/color]\n[color=#FF4444]The ★ Nazgul Champion drains 2020 life from you![/color]\n[color=#9ACD32]Your Path punishes the blow — 189 damage reflected![/color]\n[color=#FF4444]The ★ Nazgul Champion hits you for [url=4040 damage, nothing reduced this hit.][color=#FF8800]4040[/color][/url] damage![/color]\n[color=#808080]The ★ Nazgul Champion's aura slows you! (-25% flee chance)[/color]"
  ],
